' PIZERO-149: CoCo PSG test (one YM2149 at $FF5E/$FF5F, 2 MHz).
' A chord (A4, C#5, E5), then channel A on a triangle envelope, then noise.
10 CLS:PRINT"COCO PSG: CHORD"
20 FOR R=0 TO 13:READ V:POKE &HFF5E,R:POKE &HFF5F,V:NEXT
30 FOR T=1 TO 1500:NEXT
40 PRINT"ENVELOPE"
50 POKE &HFF5E,9:POKE &HFF5F,0:POKE &HFF5E,10:POKE &HFF5F,0
60 POKE &HFF5E,12:POKE &HFF5F,8:POKE &HFF5E,8:POKE &HFF5F,16:POKE &HFF5E,13:POKE &HFF5F,14
70 FOR T=1 TO 1500:NEXT
80 PRINT"NOISE":POKE &HFF5E,6:POKE &HFF5F,8:POKE &HFF5E,7:POKE &HFF5F,55:POKE &HFF5E,8:POKE &HFF5F,12
90 FOR T=1 TO 1500:NEXT
100 POKE &HFF5E,8:POKE &HFF5F,0:PRINT"DONE"
110 DATA 28,1,226,0,190,0,0,56,12,12,12,0,0,0
